# Testing and verification

## Required validation (run what applies)

| Command | When |
|---------|------|
| `npm run lint` | Always |
| `npm run type-check` | TypeScript changes |
| `npm test` | Logic, lib, component behavior |
| `npm run test:integration` | API, auth, DB, cross-module flows |
| `npm run build` | Pre-merge / release candidates |
| `npm run brand:lint` | Marketing/app UI token changes |

## Rules

- Never skip, delete, or `.skip` tests to make CI pass without explicit approval.
- Do not weaken assertions to hide regressions.
- Distinguish pre-existing failures from newly introduced failures in reports.
- Add tests when fixing bugs or adding non-trivial behavior (unless plan says otherwise).

## Orchestrator plans

Record validation evidence in plan status JSON when using the development orchestrator:

```bash
node scripts/orchestrator/record-implementation.js docs/plans/PLAN-ID.md --results '{"lint":"pass","tests":"pass"}'
```
